\",\\n  \"body\": \"Look at the windowsill plant again. One learner insists the plant\\'s food is the soil, drawn up through the roots \u2014 so the soil in the pot is a meal being delivered. The producer idea says something different: this plant is a living thing that makes its own food, and the soil supplies only materials it takes in. That soil reading cannot stand. The plant still makes its food inside itself; the soil is only one of its intakes, not the meal itself. Before you go on, commit to which reading you now hold: the plant gets its food from the soil, or the plant makes its own food and takes materials from the soil.\" \\n}'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': '1 validation error:\\n```json\\n[\\n  {\\n    \"type\": \"missing\",\\n    \"loc\": [\\n      \"response\"\\n    ],\\n    \"msg\": \"Field required\"\\n  }\\n]\\n```\\n\\nFix the errors and try again.'}], 'model': 'deepseek-flash', 'max_completion_tokens': 8000, 'stream': False}, 'extra_json': {'thinking': {'type': 'disabled'}}}"}
